---
// src/components/WhyGalacode.astro — Why It Works / Our Approach
---
<section id="why-galacode" class="relative py-24 md:py-32 bg-surface overflow-hidden border-t border-glass-5">

  <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 relative z-10">

    <!-- Section Header -->
    <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto text-center mb-14 md:mb-20">
      <div class="inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-2 px-3 py-1.5 mb-6 rounded-full border border-border bg-background shadow-sm">
        <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="13" height="13" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="text-primary"><path d="M12 20h9"/><path d="M16.5 3.5a2.12 2.12 0 0 1 3 3L7 19l-4 1 1-4L16.5 3.5z"/></svg>
        <span class="text-[10px] md:text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-text-primary">Our Approach</span>
      </div>

      <h2 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl lg:text-5xl font-bold text-text-primary leading-tight text-balance mb-5">
        Website yang <span class="text-primary block md:inline mt-1 md:mt-0">Bekerja untuk Bisnis Anda</span>
      </h2>

      <p class="text-base sm:text-lg md:text-xl text-text-secondary leading-relaxed text-balance px-2 md:px-0">
        Kami tidak hanya membangun website yang bagus secara visual. Setiap keputusan desain dan teknis dibuat dengan satu tujuan: membantu bisnis Anda mendapatkan lebih banyak pelanggan.
      </p>
    </div>

    <!-- Feature Grid: 2 large + 4 small -->
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3 gap-5 lg:gap-6">

      <!-- Feature 1 — Conversion-Focused Design (Span 2 on lg) -->
      <div class="lg:col-span-2 group bg-background border border-border/60 rounded-2xl p-6 md:p-8 transition-all duration-300 md:hover:-translate-y-1 md:hover:border-primary/30 md:hover:shadow-soft-lg active:scale-[0.98] flex flex-col sm:flex-row gap-6 items-start">
        <div class="shrink-0 w-14 h-14 flex items-center justify-center text-primary rounded-2xl bg-primary/8 border border-primary/15 transition-colors md:group-hover:bg-primary/15">
          <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M13 7h8m0 0v8m0-8l-8 8-4-4-6 6"/></svg>
        </div>
        <div>
          <h3 class="text-lg md:text-xl font-bold text-text-primary mb-2.5">Dirancang untuk Konversi</h3>
          <p class="text-text-secondary leading-relaxed text-sm md:text-base">
            Setiap elemen — dari headline, visual, hingga letak tombol — dirancang untuk mendorong pengunjung melakukan tindakan yang bermakna bagi bisnis Anda: menghubungi, memesan, atau bertanya. Bukan sekadar tampilan yang cantik.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Feature 2 — Mobile First -->
      <div class="group bg-background border border-border/60 rounded-2xl p-6 md:p-8 transition-all duration-300 md:hover:-translate-y-1 md:hover:border-primary/30 md:hover:shadow-soft-lg active:scale-[0.98] flex flex-col">
        <div class="w-12 h-12 flex items-center justify-center text-primary mb-5 rounded-xl bg-primary/8 border border-primary/15 transition-colors md:group-hover:bg-primary/15">
          <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><rect x="5" y="2" width="14" height="20" rx="2" ry="2"/><line x1="12" y1="18" x2="12.01" y2="18"/></svg>
        </div>
        <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-text-primary mb-2">Mobile-First</h3>
        <p class="text-text-secondary leading-relaxed text-sm">
          Mayoritas calon pelanggan membuka website dari HP. Setiap halaman dioptimalkan untuk tampilan mobile yang nyaman dan mudah digunakan.
        </p>
      </div>

      <!-- Feature 3 — SEO Ready -->
      <div class="group bg-background border border-border/60 rounded-2xl p-6 md:p-8 transition-all duration-300 md:hover:-translate-y-1 md:hover:border-primary/30 md:hover:shadow-soft-lg active:scale-[0.98] flex flex-col">
        <div class="w-12 h-12 flex items-center justify-center text-primary mb-5 rounded-xl bg-primary/8 border border-primary/15 transition-colors md:group-hover:bg-primary/15">
          <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><circle cx="11" cy="11" r="8"/><line x1="21" y1="21" x2="16.65" y2="16.65"/></svg>
        </div>
        <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-text-primary mb-2">Mudah Ditemukan Google</h3>
        <p class="text-text-secondary leading-relaxed text-sm">
          Struktur halaman yang rapi dengan SEO dasar yang baik agar bisnis Anda lebih mudah ditemukan calon pelanggan melalui mesin pencari.
        </p>
      </div>

      <!-- Feature 4 — Fast -->
      <div class="group bg-background border border-border/60 rounded-2xl p-6 md:p-8 transition-all duration-300 md:hover:-translate-y-1 md:hover:border-primary/30 md:hover:shadow-soft-lg active:scale-[0.98] flex flex-col">
        <div class="w-12 h-12 flex items-center justify-center text-primary mb-5 rounded-xl bg-primary/8 border border-primary/15 transition-colors md:group-hover:bg-primary/15">
          <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><polygon points="13 2 3 14 12 14 11 22 21 10 12 10 13 2"/></svg>
        </div>
        <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-text-primary mb-2">Loading Cepat</h3>
        <p class="text-text-secondary leading-relaxed text-sm">
          Pengunjung tidak menunggu lama. Website yang lambat membuat calon pelanggan pergi sebelum melihat penawaran Anda.
        </p>
      </div>

      <!-- Feature 5 — CTA Strategis -->
      <div class="group bg-background border border-border/60 rounded-2xl p-6 md:p-8 transition-all duration-300 md:hover:-translate-y-1 md:hover:border-primary/30 md:hover:shadow-soft-lg active:scale-[0.98] flex flex-col">
        <div class="w-12 h-12 flex items-center justify-center text-primary mb-5 rounded-xl bg-primary/8 border border-primary/15 transition-colors md:group-hover:bg-primary/15">
          <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M15 3h4a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v14a2 2 0 0 1-2 2h-4"/><polyline points="10 17 15 12 10 7"/><line x1="15" y1="12" x2="3" y2="12"/></svg>
        </div>
        <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-text-primary mb-2">CTA yang Strategis</h3>
        <p class="text-text-secondary leading-relaxed text-sm">
          Tombol, formulir, dan link WhatsApp ditempatkan pada posisi yang tepat sehingga mudah ditemukan dan mendorong tindakan dari pengunjung.
        </p>
      </div>

      <!-- Feature 6 — Design Custom -->
      <div class="group bg-background border border-border/60 rounded-2xl p-6 md:p-8 transition-all duration-300 md:hover:-translate-y-1 md:hover:border-primary/30 md:hover:shadow-soft-lg active:scale-[0.98] flex flex-col">
        <div class="w-12 h-12 flex items-center justify-center text-primary mb-5 rounded-xl bg-primary/8 border border-primary/15 transition-colors md:group-hover:bg-primary/15">
          <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M12 20h9"/><path d="M16.5 3.5a2.12 2.12 0 0 1 3 3L7 19l-4 1 1-4L16.5 3.5z"/></svg>
        </div>
        <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-text-primary mb-2">Desain Custom, Bukan Template</h3>
        <p class="text-text-secondary leading-relaxed text-sm">
          Setiap website dirancang sesuai identitas dan kebutuhan bisnis Anda — bukan memakai template generik yang terlihat sama dengan website lain.
        </p>
      </div>

    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<script>
  import { animate, inView } from "motion";

  const prefersReducedMotion = window.matchMedia("(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)").matches;

  if (!prefersReducedMotion) {
    const section = document.querySelector("#why-galacode .max-w-7xl");
    if (section) {
      (section as HTMLElement).style.opacity = "0";

      let animated = false;
      inView(section, () => {
        if (animated) return;
        animated = true;

        const isMobile = window.innerWidth < 768;
        const yOffset = isMobile ? 16 : 28;

        animate(
          section,
          { opacity: [0, 1], y: [yOffset, 0] },
          { duration: 0.7, easing: [0.22, 1, 0.36, 1] }
        );
      }, { margin: "-15% 0px" });
    }
  }
</script>
